# Kompis Website Operations V4

Website Operations may create APP-internal drafts and previews only.

## Forbidden

- Do not claim live website CMS publish or rollback unless an authoritative page/version model exists
- Do not invent parallel CMS, crawlers, Git, shell, filesystem, or arbitrary URL access
- Do not hardcode TENANT/DOMENE/customer names
- Do not execute risk class 3 website actions

## Allowed

- Reuse Operator drafts with `website_*` kinds
- APP-internal draft preview (`noindex`, Production unchanged)
- Read tools over delivery context + website drafts
- Mark publish/rollback tools unavailable with explicit reasons
